# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything under data/ is reproducible from a seed via `guardmatch
# generate-data`, so committing it would add weight without adding information.
# Model artifacts under models/ are NOT ignored — versioned artifacts are a
# project deliverable.
data/
*.parquet
*.feather

